{"3333410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abyss Occult", "steam_appid": 3333410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-adventure horror experience across eerie, ever-changing spaces. Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and rely on a mysterious phone to push beyond confinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up confined, disoriented, and alone. A phone lies nearby - your only source of light, direction, and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/55832210fbf2fcef9dbc594d4d337f50.poster.avif?t=1788170582\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/55832210fbf2fcef9dbc594d4d337f50.webm?t=1788170582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/55832210fbf2fcef9dbc594d4d337f50.mp4?t=1788170582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your escape leads through a series of unsettling locations, each more oppressive than the last. Abandoned structures, vast ornate spaces, tightly packed industrial corridors, and areas that feel unreal in both scale and silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/a8acdfbb7de8f4b7ff3cd7f7e1b17c5d.poster.avif?t=1788170582\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/a8acdfbb7de8f4b7ff3cd7f7e1b17c5d.webm?t=1788170582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/a8acdfbb7de8f4b7ff3cd7f7e1b17c5d.mp4?t=1788170582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The phone is central to survival. Managing its battery matters. Restoring power opens new paths. Charging it marks your progress and allows you to push deeper into the unknown. Along the way, environmental puzzles challenge your awareness, while sudden high-pressure sequences test how quickly you can react.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/9681ee121bd52e31e4dd73aa0815a196.poster.avif?t=1788170582\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/9681ee121bd52e31e4dd73aa0815a196.webm?t=1788170582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333410/extras/9681ee121bd52e31e4dd73aa0815a196.mp4?t=1788170582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct, handcrafted environments with escalating tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A phone-based gameplay system for light, power, and checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental and time-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden chase sequences where hesitation is punished</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Time is running out.&quot;</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-adventure horror experience across eerie, ever-changing spaces. Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and rely on a mysterious phone to push beyond confinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up confined, disoriented, and alone. A 